ay}{l} X \\\\ p (x) \\end{array} \\right] = \\left[ \\begin{array}{c c c c} a _ {1} & a _ {2} & \\dots & a _ {q} \\\\ p (a _ {1}) & p (a _ {2}) & \\dots & p (a _ {q}) \\end{array} \\right]"}, {"type": "text", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.07, 0.87, 0.934, 0.931], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "并且  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\sum_{i=1}^{q} p(a_{i}) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，同时还已知两个信源符号出现的联合概率分布  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p(a_{i}a_{j})(i, j = 1, 2, \\cdots, q)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，有"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 177, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.394, 0.058, 0.575, 0.074], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第 4 章 信息论基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.848, 0.06, 0.884, 0.073], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "165"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.053, 0.094, 0.715, 0.18], "content": "\\begin{array}{r l} & {\\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {q} \\sum_ {j = 1} ^ {q} p (a _ {i} a _ {j}) = 1} \\\\ {\\text {并且} p (a _ {j} \\mid a _ {i}) = \\frac {p (a _ {i} a _ {j})}{p (a _ {i})}} & {(i, j = 1, 2, \\dots , q), \\sum_ {j = 1} ^ {q} p (a _ {j} \\mid a _ {i}) = 1.} \\end{array}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.053, 0.186, 0.921, 0.29], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "下面介绍二维离散平稳信源信息熵的计算,因为信源发出的符号序列中相邻两个符号是有关联的,可以将二维信源输出的随机序列分成每两个符号一组,每组代表新信源 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "X=X_{1}X_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中的一个符号。假设组与组之间是统计独立的,就可以得到二维离散平稳信源的联合概率空间为"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.184, 0.3, 0.789, 0.4], "content": "\\begin{array}{l} \\left[ \\begin{array}{c} X _ {1} X _ {2} \\\\ P (x _ {1} x _ {2}) \\end{array} \\right] = \\left[ \\begin{array}{c c c c c} a _ {1} a _ {1} & a _ {1} a _ {2} & \\dots & a _ {q - 1} a _ {q} & a _ {q} a _ {q} \\\\ p (a _ {1} a _ {1}) & p (a _ {1} a _ {2}) & \\dots & p (a _ {q - 1} a _ {q}) & p (a _ {q} a _ {q}) \\end{array} \\right] \\\\ \\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {q} \\sum_ {j = 1} ^ {q} p (a 