 = \\{a_1, a_2, \\cdots, a_q\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ",并认为每一时刻,当信源发出一个符号后,信源所处的状态将发生转移。在第 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "l"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时刻,信源处于状态 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "E_i"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时,输出符号 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_i"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的概率为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P(x_l = a_k \\mid s_l = E_i)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ",在第 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "l-1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时刻,信源处于状态 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "E_i"}, {"type": "text", "content": ",它在下一时刻转移到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "E_j"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的状态转移概率为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P_{ij}(l) = P(s_l = E_j \\mid s_{l-1} = E_i)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.104, 0.907, 0.926, 0.925], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果状态转移概率和已知状态输出符号的概率均与时刻没有关系,即此时满足"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 181, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.401, 0.058, 0.584, 0.074], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第4章 信息论基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.855, 0.06, 0.892, 0.073], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "169"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.058, 0.092, 0.839, 0.112], "content": [{"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P(x_{l} = a_{k}\\mid s_{l} = E_{i}) = P(a_{k}\\mid E_{i}),P_{ij} = P(E_{j}\\mid E_{i})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，则称为时齐的或齐次的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.101, 0.128, 0.779, 0.147], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 4.14 若信源输出的符号序列和信源所处的状态满足下列条件:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.057, 0.156, 0.926, 0.203], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) 某一时刻信源符号的输出只与此刻信源所处的状态有关,而与以前的状态及以前的输出符号都无关。即"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.144, 0.21, 0.839, 0.231], "content": "P (x _ {l} = a _ {k} \\mid s _ {l} = E _ {i}, x _ {