 "text", "content": " ，但明文 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "X^n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和密钥相互独立，故"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.351, 0.595, 0.652, 0.613], "content": "H (K, X ^ {n}) = H (K) + H (X ^ {n})"}, {"type": "text", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.067, 0.622, 0.531, 0.64], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "所以 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "H(K\\mid Y^n) = H(K) + H(X^n) - H(Y^n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.112, 0.65, 0.496, 0.667], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "由假设条件, 可知  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "H(X^{n}) = nR_{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " , 所以"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.332, 0.677, 0.671, 0.695], "content": "H (K \\mid Y ^ {n}) = H (K) + n R _ {n} - n R _ {0}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.067, 0.704, 0.245, 0.722], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "令上式为零,解出"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.405, 0.732, 0.598, 0.765], "content": "N _ {0} = n = \\frac {H (K)}{R _ {0} - R _ {n}}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 23, "bbox": [0.069, 0.775, 0.897, 0.796], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n\\to \\infty"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时，记 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}R_n = H_\\infty ,H_\\infty"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为信源信息率；当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 充分大时，可用 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "H_{\\infty}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 代替 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "R_{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，故"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 24, "bbox": [0.4, 0.804, 0.603, 0.838], "content": "N _ {0} = n = \\frac {H (K)}{R _ {0} - H _ {\\infty}}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 25, "bbox": [0.069, 0.847, 0.935, 0.893], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "因为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "R_{0} - R_{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 或 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "R_{0} - H_{\\infty}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是明文冗余度，所以上述分析说明明文冗余度是密码分析的基础。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 26, "bbox": [0.112, 0.909, 0.936, 0.927], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 4.17 考察利用 DES 密码体制加密由 26 个字母加空格组成的英文文本。DES 密"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 193, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.386, 0.065, 0.569, 0.08], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第4章 信息论基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.84, 0.066, 0.876, 0.079], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "181"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.045, 0.099, 0.91, 0.145], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "码其明文分组长度为 64 bit, 密钥长度为 56 bit, DES 是一种相当接近随机密码的系统。英文字母信源的实际熵为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "H_{\\infty} = 1.40 \\mathrm{~bit}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 求唯一解距离 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "N_{0}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.089, 0.153, 0.632, 0.171], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解 已知 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "H(K) = 56"}, {"type": "text", "content": " bit, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "R_0 = \\log 27 = 4.76"}, {"type": "text", "content": " bit, 所以"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.28, 0.182, 0.677, 0.215], "content": "N _ {0} \\approx n = \\frac {5 6}{\\log 2 7 - 1 . 4 0} = 1 6. 9 6 = 1 7"}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.046, 0.224, 0.913, 0.272], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果对一个密码系统, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}H(K\\mid Y^n)\\neq 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，则对该系统来说，截获更多的密文并不能消除关于密钥的不确定性，这种密码系统称为理想密码系统。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.045, 0.28, 0.915, 0.463], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "还需要指出的是,上面分析的唯一解距离 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "N_{0}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 表明,当截获的密文长度大于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "N_{0}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时,原则上可以唯一确定所使用的密钥,从而可以破译该密码。但这是在假定破译者具有无限计算能力,并能充分利用信源的全部统计知识的前提下才成立的。在实际中破译者受到各种限制,不能做到完全利用资源。如果破译密码的代价超出破解信息的价值,或者破译成功所花的时间超出了所得信息的时效,则破译是无用的。因而研究密码系统在时间、人力、物力等限制条件下安全性更具有实用意义。这种安全性称为实用安全性。在第5章,将介绍通过计算复杂度理论来研究密码系统的实用安全性。"}]}, {"type": "image", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.049, 0.477, 0.115, 0.519], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.049, 0.477, 0.115, 0.519], "content": ""}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.115, 0.501, 0.206, 0.522], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "习题四"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.048, 0.537, 0.914, 0.583], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1. 同时扔一对质地均匀的骰子,当得知“两骰子面朝上点数之和为 5 ”或“面朝上点数之和为 8 ”或“两骰子面朝上点数是 3 和 6 ”时,试问这三种情况分别获得多少信息量?"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.048, 0.591, 0.915, 0.665], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2. 如果在不知道今天是星期几的情况下问朋友“明天是星期几”,则答案中含有多少信息量? 如果在已知今天是星期三的情况下提出同样的问题,则答案中能获得多少信息量(假设已知星期一至星期日的排序)?"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.049, 0.673, 0.917, 0.747], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "3. 居住某地区的女孩中有 20% 是大学生, 在女大学生中有 80% 是身高 1.6 m 以上的, 而女孩中身高 1.6 m 以上的占总数的一半。假如得知“身高 1.6 m 以上的某女孩是大学生”的消息, 问获得多少信息量?"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.049, 0.755, 0.918, 0.854], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "4. 从大量统计资料知道,男性中红绿色盲的发病率为7%,女性发病率为0.5%。如果问一位男士:“你是否是红绿色盲?”,他回答“是”或“否”,这两个回答中各含有多少信息量? 平均每个回答中含有多少信息量? 如果问一位女士,则答案中含有的平均自信息量是多少?"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.051, 0.863, 0.917, 0.909], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5. 如有 7 行 9 列的棋型方格, 若有两个质点 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "B"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 分别以等概率落入任一方格内,且它们的坐标分别为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(X_A, Y_A)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "、"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(X_B, Y_B)"}, {"type": "tex